5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we need to decide on a destination, let's be systematic. I want to understand our group dynamics from previous trips to ensure everyone is comfortable this time.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is always such a joy to travel with you all. I think it would be wise to look at how we handle the costs and arrangements.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the rooms and the bathrooms. I hope we can find a place where everyone feels relaxed and happy.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I would like to see how we can make the travel process more efficient this year.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm looking forward to it! I'd like to make sure we have a clear picture of the total costs so there are no surprises for anyone later.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, @Midori, if you are focusing on costs, I will focus on the schedule and the spatial arrangements of our past trips.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds lovely, Mizuki. I will look into the pricing of the houses and the all-in rates to see if we can simplify things.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, do you think the train or the bus is better? I want to know how we get around.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is hard to say without the data, Minato. I will look into the ferry and train timings to see if we can minimize waiting.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think it would be helpful to compare the all-in rates against separate meals. I want us to have a fixed budget we can all agree on.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
