35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,I've looked into our past patterns. It seems we struggle with the balance between togetherness and personal space depending on the accommodation type.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I see. I found that renting a whole house is quite affordable, but we must decide if we prefer a fixed all-in rate or paying for meals separately.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that some places have very strict meal times and shared bathrooms. I think having a place with more flexibility would be nice.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The travel times are a bit concerning. Some options seem to eat up a lot of our time just in transit and waiting.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I noticed that all-in rates can be a bit unfair to some, but they do give us a fixed number. I'm still weighing the options.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, your point about flexibility is important. If we are too crowded or too isolated, it affects the mood. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Mizuki. Perhaps a whole house would give us that balance? It might also make the payment process much simpler for everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"I'm worried about the bathrooms. If there is only one for all of us, it might be hard. I prefer a place where I can be quiet.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If we choose a city-based option, the transport is much more frequent. We wouldn't spend as much time waiting for a single bus or ferry.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, I agree that a whole house is simpler. If we can get a total price for the house and a set budget for food, I'd feel much better.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"A city-based stay with a shared house might be the answer. It allows for the ""absorption"" of individual time while keeping us together.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful compromise. As long as we can agree on a fair way to handle the money, I am happy with any choice.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,I like the idea of a city room because it has a door. I think I would sleep better if I had a little bit of my own space.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I strongly prefer the city option. The efficiency of the transport means we spend more time relaxing and less time in transit.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm okay with the city, as long as we can figure out the total cost upfront. I don't want to be calculating small bills every day.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,It seems we are leaning toward the city. Let's consider the options: a shared house in the city or separate hotel rooms in the city.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"A shared house sounds more cozy and friendly. It feels more like a family gathering, which I always cherish.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I think a shared house is good, but only if there are places to sit that aren't just beds. I don't like sitting on the floor all day.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,A shared house in the city is the most logical. It minimizes the travel stress and provides a central base.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I support the shared house in the city. If we can just agree on a total price for the week, I'm completely on board.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
