60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Based on our discussion, Option B provides the shared house experience, but Option C provides the individual space I believe we need.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B sounds so peaceful. A house on an island would be a lovely way to spend time together, and the cost is quite reasonable.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I am worried about Option B because of the bathrooms and the futons. Option C sounds safer for my sleep, but maybe a bit lonely.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option C is the most efficient. No waiting for ferries or hourly buses. We can arrive and start our holiday immediately.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I like Option B because the house price is clear, but Option C is also fine if we can just agree on the budget for the rooms.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, if you fear loneliness in Option C, we can plan a few group dinners. But Option B might feel too crowded for us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I think the island house would be a wonderful memory. We can help each other with the chores and enjoy the quiet of the sea.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, thank you. If we can have group dinners, I think I would prefer Option C. I really need a proper bed and a quiet room.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,The time lost to the ferry in Option B is too much. I would rather have those extra hours of peace in the city.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn. Option B is a fixed cost, which I love, but Option C is more convenient for everyone. I'll go with what the group prefers.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I believe Option C is the most logical choice to avoid the feelings of being crowded or isolated that we've had in the past.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I will support whatever makes you all the most comfortable. If the city is where you feel most at ease, then that is where we shall go.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I feel much better about Option C now. I think I can enjoy the trip more if I know I have a place to retreat to.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I am glad we are agreeing. Option C removes the stress of the journey and the waiting, which is my primary concern.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,"If we choose Option C, can we agree to set a maximum budget for the rooms now? That would make me very happy.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, we can certainly do that. Let's finalize the vote. I believe Option C is the best balance for our group's well-being.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. A happy group is the most important thing. I will vote for the city, as it seems to bring the most peace to everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'll vote for the city too. I'm looking forward to a good night's sleep and some nice group dinners.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am in full agreement. Option C is the most efficient and least stressful choice.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Midori,,"Then I will also vote for Option C. As long as we fix the budget together, I'm excited for the trip!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
